# ========================================
# Repository Cleanup Rules (2025-10-05)
# ========================================

# Disabled/deprecated directories and files
extensions/**/*.disabled/
extensions/**/disabled/
*.disabled/
**/deprecated/
**/.deprecated/

# Verification and analysis reports (temporary)
*_VERIFICATION.md
*_REPORT.md
*_ANALYSIS.md
*_SUMMARY.md
VERIFICATION_*.md
REPORT_*.md
ANALYSIS_*.md
SUMMARY_*.md
CLEANUP_*.md

# Test fixtures at root level
/.test-fixture/

# Temporary working documents
TODO_*.md
NOTES_*.md
DRAFT_*.md
WIP_*.md

# Generated compatibility and diagnostic files
extensions/**/compat_*.json
extensions/**/diag_*.json
**/install_report.md
**/install_report.json

# Old/backup files (explicit pattern)
*.old
*.bak
*.backup
*-old.*
*-backup.*
*-deprecated.*
